Bind Npc 21510 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 11510 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 527 "[Long Revenge] The Second Attack"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Guard] Melverick at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Guard] Zalk at El Morad Castle."

Requires player level >= 61 and quest 526 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Captain]Harugo is looking for you. Since you are the only one that helped on the last raid."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Captain]Falkwine is looking for you. Since you are the only one that helped on the last raid."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Oh, hello <selfname>. The great work last time, Luferson Castle is safe because of that!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "But there is a small problem. The mother of the [Gredel] that we took down last time planned a revenge and attacked our castle!\n\n[Captain] Fargo proclaimed the emergency. Go to [Elder Wizard] Drake."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh, hello <selfname>. The great work last time, Luferson Castle is safe because of that!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "But there is a small problem. The mother of the [Gredel] that we took down last time planned a revenge and attacked our castle!\n\n[Captain] Falkwine proclaimed the emergency. Go to [Elder Wizard] Drake."

On claimable
    Show quest "Problem is one of the king's loyal soldiers was killed by her. For now go to Linate Village and find [Archmage]Drake and find the remains!..."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "[Archmage]Drake is in [Linate Village] so don't get lost."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Archmage]Drake is in [Raive Village] so don't get lost."
